  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>The Knotilus implant loop does not rely on friction but is secure inside the center of the implant and locked into the PEEK anchor body. The Knotilus system is available with two guide tip options, allowing for preference.<br />\r\n</p>\r\n",
